{{!
    @template mod_these/planning_print

    Bouton du planning imprimable (PDF) de la période affichée.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * url Adresse du PDF.
    * label Libellé du bouton.

    Example context (json):
    {"url": "https://example.com/mod/these/planning.php?id=2&view=month&date=1&format=pdf",
        "label": "Imprimer le planning du mois (PDF)"}
}}
<div class="mt-3 mb-2"><a href="{{url}}" class="btn btn-primary">{{label}}</a></div>
